        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Chow RT et al. <cite>The Lancet</cite> 2009;374(9705):1897&ndash;1908. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(09)61522-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">05 &middot; {% if is_fr %}Sommeil{% else %}Sleep{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="ln-grade ln-grade--signal">{% if is_fr %}Petit &eacute;chantillon{% else %}Small sample{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Score de sommeil et m&eacute;latonine en hausse{% else %}Sleep score and melatonin both up{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {% if is_fr %}20 athl&egrave;tes, 14 jours, 30 minutes par soir. &Eacute;chantillon petit : &agrave; consid&eacute;rer comme un signal, pas comme une preuve d&eacute;finitive.{% else %}20 athletes, 14 days, 30 minutes each evening. Small sample: treat it as a signal, not as definitive proof.{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Zhao J et al. <cite>J Athl Train</cite> 2012;47(6):673&ndash;678. <a href="https://doi.org/10.4085/1062-6050-47.6.08" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">06 &middot; Performance</span>
        <span class="ln-grade ln-grade--meta">{% if is_fr %}M&eacute;ta-analyse{% else %}Meta-analysis{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Plus de r&eacute;p&eacute;titions, si la lumi&egrave;re pr&eacute;c&egrave;de l'effort{% else %}More repetitions, if the light comes first{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {% if is_fr %}13 essais randomis&eacute;s. Gain moyen de 5,5 r&eacute;p&eacute;titions et 4,1 secondes avant &eacute;puisement, obtenu surtout en application <em>avant</em> l'exercice.{% else %}13 randomised trials. Mean gain of 5.5 repetitions and 4.1 seconds to exhaustion, obtained mainly by applying light <em>before</em> exercise.{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Leal-Junior ECP et al. <cite>Lasers Med Sci</cite> 2015;30(2):925&ndash;939. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/s10103-013-1465-4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">07 &middot; {% if is_fr %}R&eacute;cup&eacute;ration{% else %}Recovery{% endif %}</span>
