        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Cr&eacute;atine kinase mieux contenue apr&egrave;s l'effort{% else %}Creatine kinase better contained after exercise{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {% if is_fr %}14 &eacute;tudes sur le marqueur sanguin de dommage musculaire. Effet net sur l'exercice localis&eacute;, <strong>non concluant sur l'exercice g&eacute;n&eacute;ral</strong> &mdash; une nuance que la plupart des pages produit passent sous silence.{% else %}14 studies on the blood marker of muscle damage. Clear effect for localised exercise, <strong>inconclusive for general exercise</strong> &mdash; a nuance most product pages leave out.{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Machado AF et al. <cite>Clin J Sport Med</cite> 2020;30(3):267&ndash;274. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1097/JSM.0000000000000606" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">08 &middot; {% if is_fr %}Articulations{% else %}Joints{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="ln-grade ln-grade--meta">{% if is_fr %}M&eacute;ta-analyse{% else %}Meta-analysis{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Meilleur que l'exercice seul, en compl&eacute;ment{% else %}Better than exercise alone, as an adjunct{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {% if is_fr %}10 essais randomis&eacute;s sur l'arthrose du genou, tous de bon score PEDro. Le mot important est <em>en compl&eacute;ment</em> : la lumi&egrave;re s'ajoute au mouvement, elle ne le remplace pas.{% else %}10 randomised trials on knee osteoarthritis, all with good PEDro scores. The important words are <em>as an adjunct</em>: light adds to movement, it does not replace it.{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Ahmad MA et al. <cite>Physiotherapy</cite> 2021;114:85&ndash;95. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physio.2021.03.011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
